Source: stranded
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Bertrand Fan <bert@bert.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-sequence-installsysusers, git, libdrm-dev, libsdl2-dev, pkgconf
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/bertrandom/stranded
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: stranded
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: polkitd, v4l-utils
Description: Johnny Castaway screensaver, as a full screen service
 Stranded plays the 1992 Johnny Castaway screensaver full screen, straight
 through KMS/DRM, as a systemd service. It has a web page and an API to
 control it, a night mode that turns the display off, and widescreen
 support.
 .
 The original game's data files aren't included: put RESOURCE.MAP,
 RESOURCE.001 and, optionally, the sounds in /var/lib/stranded.
